usage: prepare.py [-h] --parents PARENTS --source-root SOURCE_ROOT --output
                  OUTPUT [--apks APKS] [--verify]

Bind every source/part role and inspect the two immutable diagnostic APKs.
This is a read-only input operation until the two APKs are assembled into a
new owned directory. It never contacts ADB. AAPT2 is the explicitly added
dependency; the sixteen source-design parent declarations remain unchanged.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --parents PARENTS
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --output OUTPUT
  --apks APKS
  --verify
